# rules for localization in this project 
- Each module/page must keep its own translation file inside its folder.  
- Do not add or edit keys in other modules’ translation files.  
- Use common.json only for global/shared keys.  
- Keys must follow hierarchical naming: {module}.{section}.{element}.  
- Avoid generic keys (e.g., "status"); always namespace unless global.  
- Add new keys without rewriting or reformatting the entire JSON file.  
- Always keep JSON valid, clean, and ordered (alphabetical or logical).
- for styling purpuse you must only use tailwind css not any other ui library
- create a folder about docs and always create any .md file in it not in the root